@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT

### Lấy revision và cấu hình
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/store
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thay expectedRevision bằng revision lấy từ GET
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/store
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 0,
  "configuration": {
    "storeName": "LemonadeX",
    "legalName": null,
    "taxCode": null,
    "supportEmail": "support@example.com",
    "supportPhone": "0901234567",
    "address": "Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh",
    "logoUrl": null,
    "websiteUrl": "https://example.com",
    "businessHours": "09:00–21:00"
  }
}

### Thanh toán
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Giao hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/shipping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Đơn hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thông báo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/notification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hệ thống chung
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/general
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Phương thức thanh toán
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tạo phương thức giao hàng
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/shipping-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"STANDARD","name":"Giao hàng tiêu chuẩn","provider":"Manual carrier","baseFee":30000,"estimatedDays":3,"enabled":true}

### Báo giá giao hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/shipping/quote?methodCode=STANDARD&merchandiseAmount=200000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lịch sử
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/settings/store/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cấu hình công khai
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/store/configuration
